<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 308.39 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 308.39 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought 308.39 million rands worth of South African bonds on Friday after buying 98.30 million rands worth on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
